1
00:00:00,488 --> 00:00:04,578
Okay, um, oh, how about Crash?
Howard "Crash" Wolowitz.

2
00:00:06,036 --> 00:00:10,876
Terrific. The astronauts would love hurtling
through space with a guy named Crash.

3
00:00:12,292 --> 00:00:16,252
All right, uh, how about?...
Oh, how about Rocket Man?

4
00:00:18,048 --> 00:00:20,338
(Leonard:)That's not bad.
Howard "Rocket Man" Wolowitz.

5
00:00:20,508 --> 00:00:23,388
(Howard:)It's great, but I told you,
I don't get to pick my nickname.

6
00:00:23,553 --> 00:00:25,553
(Howard:)It has to come from the other astronauts.

7
00:00:25,722 --> 00:00:28,262
(Raj:)Maybe there's a way
to get them to come up with it.

8
00:00:28,433 --> 00:00:29,853
(Howard:)Like how?

9
00:00:30,018 --> 00:00:32,188
(Leonard:)Once I tried carrying around
a Duncan yo-yo...

10
00:00:32,354 --> 00:00:35,524
(Leonard:)...hoping the other kids
would start calling me Duncan.

11
00:00:36,024 --> 00:00:39,154
- Did it work?
- No, they ended up calling me Sock Mouth...

12
00:00:40,987 --> 00:00:44,737
(Leonard:)...because they took away my yo-yo
and stuffed their socks in my mouth.

13
00:00:47,035 --> 00:00:51,495
(Raj:)Okay. Uh, what if we make
"Rocket Man" your ringtone...

14
00:00:51,665 --> 00:00:56,085
(Raj:)...and the next time you talk to those guys,
I'll call you and they'll hear it.

15
00:00:56,252 --> 00:00:57,882
That's not a terrible plan.

16
00:00:58,046 --> 00:01:04,026
(Raj:)They don't call me
Brown Dynamite for nothing.

